{"title": "Bhaal's Edict (Condition)", "pageid": 30281, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bhaal's_Edict_(Condition)", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Has tick type", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaal's Edict Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Bhaal%27s_Edict_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Bhaal's Edict</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>If you don't kill another creature before the end of your next turn, you will die instantly. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: end of turn</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Ward_(Condition)\" title=\"Death Ward (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Death Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Ward_(Condition)\" title=\"Death Ward (Condition)\">Death Ward</a> <i>does</i> protect party members from <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Edict\" title=\"Bhaal's Edict\">Bhaal's Edict</a>, although in this case they lose all of their current buffs and conditions as if they'd briefly died.</li>\n<li>The death effect appears to be applied during <a href=\"/wiki/Boon_of_Bhaal\" title=\"Boon of Bhaal\">Boon of Bhaal</a>'s turn, rather than when the affected party member's turn ends.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Sources_of_Bhaal.27s_Edict\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Bhaal's_Edict\">Sources of Bhaal's Edict</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Edict\" title=\"Bhaal's Edict\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaal's Edict\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal%27s_Edict\" title=\"Bhaal's Edict\">Bhaal's Edict</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714212232\